{"kind":"html","caption":"动画用示例 root = [1,null,2,3] 展示迭代中序遍历：沿左链入栈，无法继续时弹栈访问，再转向右子树。栈保证节点按“左子树 → 根节点 → 右子树”的顺序进入结果，最终得到 [1,3,2]；空树直接返回空数组。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>二叉树的中序遍历</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:14px}main{width:100%;max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 24px 40px}.lead{margin:0 0 20px;color:#a8a8a8;line-height:1.7}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(300px,1.25fr) minmax(260px,.75fr);gap:20px;align-items:start}.panel{min-width:0;padding:20px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3b3b3b;border-radius:10px}.panel h2{margin:0 0 18px;font-size:16px;color:#fff}.tree{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(54px,1fr));grid-template-rows:auto auto auto;gap:16px 10px;align-items:center;min-height:260px}.node{width:58px;min-height:58px;margin:auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:3px;border:2px solid #666;border-radius:50%;background:#333;color:#eee;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s,color .35s}.node strong,.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.node small{font-size:13px;color:#aaa}.n1{grid-column:2/4;grid-row:1}.nil{grid-column:1/3;grid-row:2;text-align:center;color:#777}.n2{grid-column:3/5;grid-row:2}.n3{grid-column:2/4;grid-row:3}.edge{color:#777;text-align:center;line-height:1.5}.e12{grid-column:3/4;grid-row:1;align-self:end;margin-bottom:-10px}.e23{grid-column:3/4;grid-row:2;align-self:end;margin-bottom:-12px}.node.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.node.done{background:#263746;border-color:#3794ff;color:#8fc8ff}.status{margin-top:18px;padding:14px 16px;min-height:68px;border-left:4px solid #3794ff;background:#202b35;line-height:1.65}.state-grid{display:grid;gap:18px}.label{margin-bottom:8px;color:#aaa}.boxes{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;min-height:48px}.box{min-width:48px;padding:9px 10px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #555;border-radius:6px;background:#303030;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.box.hot{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.empty{color:#777;padding:10px 0}.rule{margin-top:20px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #444;line-height:1.8}.rule b{color:#3794ff}.cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:20px}.case{padding:12px;border:1px solid #444;border-radius:7px;background:#292929;line-height:1.7}.case span{color:#8fc8ff}@media(max-width:720px){main{padding:20px 14px 32px}.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tree{min-height:240px}.cases{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n  /* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}main{max-width:560px!important;padding:8px 10px 10px!important}.lead{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important;margin:0 0 6px!important}.layout{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:8px!important}.panel{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important}.panel h2{font-size:13px!important;margin:0 0 6px!important}.tree{min-height:auto!important;gap:8px!important}.node{width:36px!important;min-height:36px!important;height:36px!important;font-size:12px!important;border-width:1px!important}.node small{font-size:10px!important}.status{border-left-width:3px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;margin-top:8px!important;min-height:auto!important}.box{min-width:32px!important;padding:4px 6px!important;font-size:12px!important;border-radius:4px!important}.cases{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:6px!important;margin-top:8px!important}.case{padding:8px 10px!important;font-size:12px!important}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<p class=\"lead\">示例：<span class=\"mono\">root = [1,null,2,3]</span>。蓝色节点表示当前操作对象，每一步停留 1.8 秒。</p>\n<div class=\"layout\">\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h2>树与当前指针</h2>\n<div class=\"tree\">\n<div class=\"node n1\" data-node=\"1\"><strong>1</strong><small>根节点</small></div>\n<div class=\"nil\">左子树为空</div>\n<div class=\"edge e12\">↘ 右</div>\n<div class=\"node n2\" data-node=\"2\"><strong>2</strong><small>右孩子</small></div>\n<div class=\"edge e23\">↙ 左</div>\n<div class=\"node n3\" data-node=\"3\"><strong>3</strong><small>左孩子</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"status\" id=\"status\">准备开始迭代遍历。</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h2>迭代状态</h2>\n<div class=\"state-grid\">\n<div><div class=\"label\">当前节点 current</div><div class=\"boxes\" id=\"current\"></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"label\">栈 stack（左侧为栈底）</div><div class=\"boxes\" id=\"stack\"></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"label\">遍历结果 result</div><div class=\"boxes\" id=\"result\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rule\"><b>循环规则：</b>当前节点非空时，入栈并向左；当前节点为空时，弹栈访问并转向其右孩子。</div>\n<div class=\"cases\">\n<div class=\"case\">空树 <span class=\"mono\">[] → []</span></div>\n<div class=\"case\">单节点 <span class=\"mono\">[1] → [1]</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst steps=[\n{c:1,s:[],r:[],a:1,t:'从根节点 1 开始，当前节点非空。'},\n{c:null,s:[1],r:[],a:1,t:'将 1 压入栈，继续查看它的左孩子；左孩子为空。'},\n{c:2,s:[],r:[1],a:1,d:[1],t:'弹出 1 并访问，结果加入 1；随后转向 1 的右孩子 2。'},\n{c:3,s:[2],r:[1],a:2,d:[1],t:'将 2 压入栈，再沿左边走到节点 3。'},\n{c:null,s:[2,3],r:[1],a:3,d:[1],t:'将 3 压入栈；它没有左孩子，准备弹栈。'},\n{c:null,s:[2],r:[1,3],a:3,d:[1,3],t:'弹出并访问 3，结果变为 [1,3]；3 没有右孩子。'},\n{c:null,s:[],r:[1,3,2],a:2,d:[1,3,2],t:'弹出并访问 2，得到 [1,3,2]；栈与当前节点都为空，遍历完成。'}\n];\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id);\nfunction boxes(id,arr,hot){const el=$(id);el.innerHTML=arr.length?arr.map((v,i)=>'<div class=\"box '+(i===hot?'hot':'')+'\">'+v+'</div>').join(''):'<div class=\"empty\">空</div>'}\nfunction render(x){document.querySelectorAll('.node').forEach(n=>{const v=Number(n.dataset.node);n.classList.toggle('active',v===x.a);n.classList.toggle('done',(x.d||[]).includes(v))});boxes('current',x.c===null?[]:[x.c],0);boxes('stack',x.s,x.s.length-1);boxes('result',x.r,x.r.length-1);$('status').textContent=x.t}\nlet i=0;render(steps[i]);setInterval(()=>{i=(i+1)%steps.length;render(steps[i])},1800);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
